<h2 id="why-newark">Why Newark is good ground for side gigs</h2>
<p>A few local facts shape how you should hustle here:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>The airport is an economic engine.</strong> Newark Liberty is a major United Airlines hub, and travelers need rides, parking, pet care while away and luggage-heavy deliveries.</li>
