  <li><strong>It's a university town.</strong> Rutgers–Newark, NJIT, Essex County College and Seton Hall Law bring thousands of students who need tutoring, and who are also an affordable workforce.</li>
  <li><strong>Big employers downtown.</strong> Prudential, PSEG, Panasonic North America, Audible and Horizon Blue Cross Blue Shield employ professionals who outsource chores and childcare.</li>
